% the fade_out fix (body stays loud, tail falls away; explicit st=duration-N, and with a
% start_seconds delay the fade rides the shifted end); _per_track_chain ordering + acopy;
% auto_balance dry/apply (measured-LUFS gap, gains land on role targets, volume matches dB,
% no artifacts on dry); extract legacy default (pcm_s16le/16k/mono), copy preserves codec+
% picks the container ext, sample_rate/mp3 honored, and every validation guard; and the
% full_mix speech+music+sfx ducking path emitting a real audio stream (the asplit orphan-pad
% regression).
